# Build context is the REPO ROOT (backend Dockerfile copies backend/ and
# .claude/prompts) — exclude everything else, especially frontend's
# node_modules (600MB+, and Windows file modes break the tar checksum).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mimosa
**/.zcode
frontend
infra
docs
scripts
semantic
*.md
